Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 09:08:47 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] feat(backend): fault-detection PCAP analysis job API

Adds the /ai/fault-detection router and a job service that accepts an uploaded
.pcap/.pcapng (<= 256 MiB, magic header checked before it is written), decodes
it with TShark + dsV2Gshark, runs the charger fault detectors, and exposes job
status/result with a lifecycle that deletes the raw capture and temporary
telemetry once a job finishes or fails; small job records are kept 30 days for
traceability. Wired into backend/main.py. .env.example documents the three new
settings (data root, AI project path, Python interpreter).

Implemented with Codex 2026-09-17..22 and committed from the working tree as
handed over.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
